&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help make the world more hospitable &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The hospitality industry is uniquely human, and it deserves technology that’s just as inspiring as the people behind it. At Mews, we’re transforming the industry with a platform that helps hotels run smarter, move faster and create better guest experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work with smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do. You’ll have autonomy and the trust to make good decisions and move quickly. And you’ll enjoy a real sense of purpose as you see the impact of what we’re building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re motivated by ownership, curiosity and meaningful impact, and are driven to deliver consistent high performance, you’ll feel at home here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let&#39;s get into the specifics. It’s impossible to capture every nuance of a role – especially at a rapidly growing company like Mews – but if we had to distil it into a job description (which we do because this is a job description), it would be this:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11&quot; data-local-id=&quot;93795b139292&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Analytics Engineer to lead the data architecture behind our most business-critical financial work: billing, regulatory reporting (&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;EMI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;), &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;SOX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; compliance, financial forecasting and executive reporting. You&#39;ll design the data solutions that finance, payments and audit teams depend on, set the standards for how analytics work ships, and mentor others on the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;400&quot; data-local-id=&quot;04e5a5743e87&quot;&gt;This is a shape-the-team role. You&#39;ll have real influence over how we work, what we build and the pace we move at. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We expect you to use AI fluently where it adds leverage in modeling, code review and debugging, and to apply clear judgment on where it doesn&#39;t.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;663&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8a127a4eec79&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;69983cc5-7a69-4c5e-8cb0-2d1476fbd536&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;683&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f86dd91255b3&quot;&gt;Lead the architecture and development of high-impact data models in dbt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;759&quot; data-local-id=&quot;637843ae65c8&quot;&gt;Architect data solutions across business-critical financial workflows, including billing, regulatory reporting (&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;EMI&lt;/span&gt;), &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;SOX&lt;/span&gt; compliance, financial forecasting and executive reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;943&quot; data-local-id=&quot;328036a130de&quot;&gt;Mentor analytics engineers and review code to uphold standards across the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1026&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3cadb74519a9&quot;&gt;Find and fix performance bottlenecks across the data stack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1089&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ea6a753ebf9a&quot;&gt;Translate business problems into clean, efficient data solutions in close partnership with stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1197&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6ac1ef55faf8&quot;&gt;Set team-wide standards for documentation, CI/CD, observability and testing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1277&quot; data-local-id=&quot;84f45985e13a&quot;&gt;Set the team&#39;s norms for where AI belongs in our workflow, from model development to code review, and where human oversight stays non-negotiable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1426&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bfbd44915343&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;31d514bd-be3b-41a0-8411-e3530a1faabd&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1442&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ebab218e4ac8&quot;&gt;5+ years in analytics engineering or a similar role, with a track record of designing data models that hold up to cross-functional use.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1581&quot; data-local-id=&quot;cf5dc9cd98d7&quot;&gt;Deep, hands-on expertise with dbt, SQL and Python on a modern data platform (Databricks or equivalent).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1688&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5907f55d915c&quot;&gt;Strong grasp of pipeline orchestration, testing frameworks and the practices that keep them healthy at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1801&quot; data-local-id=&quot;766324799f66&quot;&gt;Comfortable setting technical direction, mentoring engineers and working closely with finance, payments and audit stakeholders. You can explain a trade-off clearly and influence the decision that follows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2009&quot; data-local-id=&quot;94d52040e4ec&quot;&gt;You use AI hands-on in your day-to-day technical work and can show specific examples of how it has changed the way you build, review or debug data models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2167&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d29af94c37b5&quot;&gt;You catch AI&#39;s errors before anything ships, including hallucinations, overconfident answers and plausible-but-wrong code, and you have a clear sense of where human oversight stays non-negotiable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Spain&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€65.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€85.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Czechia&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;1 008 000 Kč&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;1 320 000 Kč CZK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;UK&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£60,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£72,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;France&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€54.500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€65.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary ranges are provided in good faith and reflect current market conditions and internal pay structures. Final compensation may be adjusted based on funding, budget constraints, or exceptional candidate qualifications, but will remain within reasonable proximity to the stated range.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This salary disclosure is provided in compliance with applicable pay transparency legislation. We are committed to equal pay practices and prohibit salary history inquiries during our recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If the location you&#39;re applying from wasn&#39;t originally advertised for this role, salary range information is available upon request at any point during the application/interview process - your recruiter will be able to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our success is powered by our incredible people, supported by benefits that help them thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No matter where you’re based, you’ll enjoy:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited paid holiday (yes, really)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in our company share program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave (6 months fully paid for primary caregivers, 2 months for secondary, available after one year of service)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual Learning budget of €300 (and more for high performers) to support your development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly &quot;EDGE&quot; time to Explore, Develop, Grow, and Elevate yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A work from anywhere policy with flexibility to work abroad for a few weeks each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation options, available after one year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, hybrid working options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A home office setup budget to make your workspace your own and a monthly work-from-home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Claude tokens, so you can automate workflows and build smarter, more efficient ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Local benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll receive additional benefits that vary by location, from healthcare and retirement plans to team events, socials and other perks. Ask us about it during your interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunities employer. We value teams that reflect the diversity of the customers and communities we serve. Different perspectives make better ideas, stronger products and a more welcoming company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also believe transparency is important when deciding if you&#39;re the right fit. Mews is an ambitious, high-pressure environment of continuous learning and high standards. Success here requires resilience, adaptability and a willingness to solve difficult problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A few things that define how we work:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High autonomy means high responsibility. People are expected to take ownership and drive outcomes. There isn’t a detailed playbook for everything, and that’s part of what makes the work challenging – and rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change is constant. We’re growing quickly and adapting as we scale. Teams, processes and priorities continue to evolve, and only people who stay curious and agile will thrive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re remote-first, not relationship-free. Flexibility is core to how we work, but strong relationships still matter. Our teams are global, so we need expert collaborators and communicators to help us move forward together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI is an integral part of our processes. It’s not here to steal people’s jobs, but to amplify efficiency and productivity. We’re motivated to proactively use the technology to seek out better ways of working and share our findings with the rest of the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If there&#39;s anything we can do to support you during the application process, let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don&#39;t discriminate on the basis of race, religion, colour, nationality, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One final thing: don&#39;t hold back. If you don&#39;t meet 100% of the criteria in this job description but you&#39;re certain you could make a big impact, apply. Everyone should have equal access to opportunities, and we&#39;re committed to providing an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If Mews sounds like the kind of environment where you&#39;d thrive, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW4324591 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW4324591 BCX8&quot;&gt;As a leader in Lawful and Location Intelligence, SS8 helps make societies safer. Our commitment is to extract, analyze, and visualize the critical intelligence that gives law enforcement, intelligence agencies, and emergency services the real-time insights that help save lives. Our high performance, flexible, and future-proof solutions also enable mobile network operators to achieve regulatory compliance with minimum disruption, time, and cost. SS8 is trusted by the largest government agencies, communications providers, and systems integrators globally.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a customer-facing Senior Solutions Engineer to support sales of SS8’s portfolio across Law Enforcement (LEA), Intelligence Community (IC), and Communications Service Providers (CSPs) across the APAC region. This role sits at the intersection of deep technical expertise and strategic sales—translating complex mission needs into deployable, scalable solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a highly skilled Senior Solutions Engineer, you will leverage your expertise to deliver pre-sales engineering support as a subject matter expert. This role involves extensive engagement with customers and partners, ensuring the highest technical and professional standards while upholding SS8’s customer-first approach. You will serve as the primary technical representative to customers, articulating SS8’s solution capabilities and playing a key role in influencing customer decisions and successful solution adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll partner closely with sales, product, and delivery teams to drive technical wins, shape customer architectures, and ensure SS8 solutions align with operational and compliance requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pre-Sales &amp;amp; Solution Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical discovery sessions to understand customer mission requirements across lawful intercept, location intelligence, and data analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent SS8 and its partner ecosystem in designing and delivering end-to-end solutions tailored to customer and prospect requirements spanning telecom networks, data collection, mediation, analytics, and visualization platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical sales cycle: architecture, solution positioning, demos, POCs, and RFP/RFI responses with innovative and differentiated approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate vague “we need intel” asks into concrete system designs (and push back when needed).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Engagement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted technical advisor to LEA, IC, and telecom stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present complex solutions clearly to both engineers and non-technical decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support customer workshops, technical deep dives, and executive briefings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bridge the gap between operational users and IT/network teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture &amp;amp; Integration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop high-level and detailed architectures integrating SS8 solutions into existing customer environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure alignment with telecom standards, lawful intercept frameworks, and regulatory requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with delivery teams to ensure smooth transition from design to implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with account teams to develop winning strategies for new and existing opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own creation of proposals, quotes, SOWs, and technical documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support competitive positioning and articulate differentiators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product &amp;amp; Feedback Loop&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide structured feedback to product management on emerging trends, customer challenges, requirements analysis and field-driven insights based on field experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence product direction with real-world use cases and customer pain points.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Required Experience &amp;amp; Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years in solution and systems engineering, sales engineering, network engineering, or solution architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to design and size high-capacity, high-performance, mission-critical systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of telecom network architectures and signaling protocols:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3G, 4G LTE/EPC, and 5G Core&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IMS, VoLTE, VoIP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IP networking (routing, switching, protocols)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with lawful intercept frameworks and systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of data flows, packet capture, and network-based data collection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Knowledge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting or working with:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Law Enforcement Agencies (LEA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intelligence Community (IC)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Telecommunications Service Providers (CSPs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to OSINT, location intelligence, or analytics platforms is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with virtualization and/or cloud-native environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of databases and storage systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of compliance, regulatory, and legal considerations in telecom and surveillance environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Engineering Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to run technical sales cycles and close complex deals. Experience responding to RFPs/RFIs and building technical proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation and demo skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills, with significant experience engaging directly with customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly professional, detail-oriented, and analytical, with the ability to operate independently and take initiative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capable of contributing as a key member of the technical leadership team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interpersonal Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to simplify complex systems without dumbing them down.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable pushing back on unrealistic customer expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication across technical, operational, and executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-driven, adaptable, and able to operate in ambiguous environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with big data platforms (Hadoop, Spark, Elasticsearch).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of AI/ML applications in intelligence or telecom analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud experience (AWS, Azure, or private cloud deployments).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;50% typical, 75% peak&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Join a company where your ideas, expertise, and ambition can make a real difference.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At SS8, we&#39;re committed to fostering a culture of collaboration, innovation, and continuous growth. Whether you&#39;re developing new solutions, supporting customers, or driving business success, you&#39;ll be part of a team that values your contributions and invests in your future.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW127407533 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW127407533 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW195719623 BCX8&quot;&gt;SS8 does not discriminate&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun AdvancedProofingIssueV2Themed SCXW195719623 BCX8&quot;&gt;on the basis of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW195719623 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;age, disability, gender reassignment, marriage or civil partnership, pregnancy or maternity, race, religion or belief, sex, or sexual orientation, and provides reasonable adjustments throughout the recruitment process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW17735712 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW17735712 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW64983816 BCX8&quot;&gt;SS8 does not accept unsolicited resumes from staffing agencies, search firms, or third parties. Any resumes &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW64983816 BCX8&quot;&gt;submitted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW64983816 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;without a signed agreement in place will be considered the property of Company, and no fees will be paid if a candidate is hired as a result.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div id=&quot;model-response-message-contentr_ce05398d7259c8f0&quot; class=&quot;markdown markdown-main-panel enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;model-response-message-contentr_ce05398d7259c8f0&quot; class=&quot;markdown markdown-main-panel enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Notre Team Data lake recherche un·e Senior Product Manager (f/m/d) en CDI basé·e à Lille ou Paris&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez Decathlon, nous croyons au pouvoir du sport pour unir et inspirer. Notre mission : au travers du sport rendre le bien être accessible au plus grand nombre, partout dans le monde. Pour y parvenir, la data est au cœur de notre stratégie, elle guide chaque décision, de la conception du produit à l&#39;expérience client.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au cœur de l’entité Decathlon Digital, nous recherchons notre futur.e Senior Product Manager pour rejoindre les équipes Data Factory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cette plateforme technologique, globale à tout le groupe de manière internationale, soutient le développement de l’usage de la Data et de l’IA chez Decathlon, du calcul du chiffre d’affaires à l’aide de conception de produits innovants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous sommes garants des outils, de la scalabilité, de la mise en place et du respect des bonnes pratiques de développement. Nous accompagnons au quotidien l’ensemble des acteurs métiers tels que Data Analysts, Data Engineers, Analytics Engineers, Data Scientists.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La Data Factory est conçue comme une&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Modern Data Stack&lt;/em&gt;, avec un lakehouse comme centre de gravité.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elle est ensuite divisée en plusieurs équipes, chacune étant pilotée par un leader technique, avec comme ambition de travailler avec un.e Product Manager attitré.e.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre équipe&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Data Lake&lt;/strong&gt; est donc la brique fondamentale de cette mission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre mission ? Mettre à disposition des solutions de stockage pour l’ensemble de la Data Platform de Decathlon, tout en garantissant la gouvernance, robustesse et scalabilité par défaut. Véritable pilier de la gouvernance technique du patrimoine de données, notre équipe gère les métadonnées via le metastore Unity Catalog et les data contracts, permettant ainsi de construire une observabilité globale de la plateforme (usage, lignage, etc.). Un terrain de jeu technique à fort impact et aux défis d&#39;envergure internationale !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;L&#39;équipe est composée actuellement de :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1 Product Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1 Data Architect&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1 Data Engineer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1 Software Engineer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 Ops Engineer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exemples de&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;challenges actuels&lt;/strong&gt; :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Améliorer notre offre de support pour faciliter le parcours utilisateur (documentation, gestion des incidents, ...)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discussion avec les équipes Data/IA des pays et domaines sur leurs challenges du moment (données sensibles, données privées, ...) pour définir les priorités de nos équipes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comment faciliter la gouvernance des données ? Par exemple intégrer des règles automatiques de validation des données, data contractualization, ...&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rationalisation de notre offre et décommissionnement du legacy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;TA FUTURE CONTRIBUTION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre ambition groupe, celle d’améliorer l’expérience digitale de nos clients, nous amène à une nouvelle approche orientée clients, une approche produit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Le/La Product Manager de l&#39;équipe Data Lake:&lt;/p&gt;
